,"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-24T10:55:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-25T14:40:46Z","closed_at":"2026-07-25T14:38:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121714","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121714","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121714.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121714.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-25T14:38:01Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #121713 \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nThis PR fixes an issue where attempting to close a floating game view window in projects with `auto_accept_quit` set to `false` causes the window frame & decorations to be disabled/hidden while the game process & remote debugger remain running in a \"ghost\" state.\r\n\r\n### The Problem\r\nIn `GameView::_window_close_request()`, `window_wrapper->set_window_enabled(false)` was being called unconditionally at the beginning of the function before delegating the close request to the running game process.\r\n\r\nWhen a project has `auto_accept_quit = false`, the game engine intentionally ignores `NOTIFICATION_WM_CLOSE_REQUEST` & waits for script logic to explicitly call `get_tree().quit()`. Because GameView had already disabled the `window_wrapper`, the UI container hid its window frame/decorations immediately, leaving the game process running continuously in the background without a visible outer window or title bar.\r\n\r\n### The Fix\r\n- Moved `window_wrapper->set_window_enabled(false)` & `embedded_process->reset_timers()` into the branch reserved for forced resets (when the game is paused or embedding is still in progress).\r\n\r\n- Allowed graceful close requests (`embedded_process->request_close()`) to leave the `window_wrapper` active.\r\n\r\n   -  If `auto_accept_quit` is `true`, the game process exits naturally, triggering `_stop_pressed()`, which safely handles disabling the window wrapper.\r\n\r\n   - If `auto_accept_quit` is `false`, the game process ignores the close request & the window wrapper remains open & interactive as expected.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121714/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}